Hou Yi Shoots the Suns — Shadow Puppetry demo · Polargate · PolarMotion

All puppets, scenery, carving patterns, story staging and melodies are original, generated by code in this folder.
Traditional motifs used generically (fish-scale armour, cloud scrolls, meander, coin and lattice patterns, flame tongues); no specific historical puppet is copied.

